<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Translation YAML Tools — demo</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; margin: 2rem; line-height: 1.5; }
        h1 { margin-top: 0; }
        table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 1rem 0; }
        th, td { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
        th { background: #f5f5f5; }
        code { background: #f0f0f0; padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.9em; }
        .missing { color: #b00020; }
        .ok { color: #0a7a0a; }
        ul.compact { margin: 0.25rem 0; padding-left: 1.25rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Translation YAML Tools — demo ({{ demo_label }})</h1>
<p>This page validates <strong>default locale</strong>, <strong>enabled locales</strong>, <strong>YAML locations</strong> (including an extra <code>translations_extra/</code> path), and <strong>missing files / keys</strong> per domain versus the default locale.</p>

<section>
    <h2>Symfony / Translator</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>translator.default_locale</strong>: <code>{{ report.defaultLocale }}</code></li>
        <li><strong>kernel.enabled_locales</strong>: {% for loc in report.enabledLocales %}<code>{{ loc }}</code>{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}</li>
        <li><strong>translator.fallback_locales</strong>: {% if report.fallbackLocales|length %}{% for loc in report.fallbackLocales %}<code>{{ loc }}</code>{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% else %}<em>(none)</em>{% endif %}</li>
        <li><strong>Bundle <code>TranslationDefaultLocaleResolver</code></strong> (respects <code>nowo_translation_yaml_tools.default_locale</code> when set): <code>{{ report.bundleResolvedDefaultLocale }}</code></li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Resolved translation directories</h2>
    <p>Same resolution as the bundle commands (<code>translator.default_path</code> + <code>framework.translator.paths</code> from YAML).</p>
    <ul>
        {% for dir in report.directories %}
            <li><code>{{ dir }}</code></li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p><em>Hints:</em></p>
    <ul class="compact">
        {% for line in report.directorySourcesHelp %}
            <li>{{ line }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Domains &amp; YAML files</h2>
    {% for domain in report.domains %}
        <h3>Domain <code>{{ domain.name }}</code></h3>
        <table>
            <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Locale</th>
                <th>YAML file</th>
                <th>Enabled locale missing file?</th>
            </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
            {% for loc, path in domain.files %}
                <tr>
                    <td><code>{{ loc }}</code></td>
                    <td>{% if path %}<code>{{ path }}</code>{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
                    <td>—</td>
                </tr>
            {% endfor %}
            {% for loc in domain.missingFilesForEnabledLocales %}
                <tr>
                    <td><code>{{ loc }}</code></td>
                    <td class="missing">—</td>
                    <td class="missing">Yes (expected in this demo for some locales)</td>
                </tr>
            {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>

        {% if domain.missingKeysVsDefault|length %}
            <p><strong>Keys present in default locale (<code>{{ report.defaultLocale }}</code>) but missing in other files:</strong></p>
            <table>
                <thead>
                <tr><th>Locale</th><th>Missing keys</th></tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                {% for loc, keys in domain.missingKeysVsDefault %}
                    <tr>
                        <td><code>{{ loc }}</code></td>
                        <td><ul class="compact">{% for k in keys %}<li><code>{{ k }}</code></li>{% endfor %}</ul></td>
                    </tr>
                {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        {% else %}
            <p class="ok">No key gaps vs default for loaded locale files in this domain.</p>
        {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Inline translations (Twig)</h2>
    <p>{{ 'demo.inline_banner'|trans({'%product%': 'Translation YAML Tools'}) }}</p>
    <p><em>{% trans %}Hello, demo visitor{% endtrans %}</em> — second line uses the <code>{% trans %}</code> tag (message id = English source string; Spanish lives in <code>messages.es.yaml</code>).</p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>CLI (inside the container)</h2>
    <p>From the demo directory, <code>make translation-yaml-demos</code> runs the bundle commands in dry-run mode. <code>make translation-yaml-inline-preview</code> briefly rewrites <code>messages.en.yaml</code> with <code>--inline</code> (flow YAML) and restores it.</p>
    <pre><code>php bin/console nowo:translation-yaml:tree --dry-run --domain=messages --locale=en
php bin/console nowo:translation-yaml:sort --dry-run --domain=messages --locale=en
php bin/console nowo:translation-yaml:sort --inline --domain=messages --locale=en
php bin/console nowo:translation-yaml:fill-missing --dry-run --domain=messages --target-locale=es</code></pre>
</section>
</body>
</html>
